  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Capium 365: Manage\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 8 Oct, 2025 at  6:56 PM\n\n\t\tThe Capium 365 Manage section provides accountants with a centralised hub to oversee all their clients efficiently. It offers a high-level, bird’s-eye view across multiple key areas, streamlining practice-wide operations. \n\nKey management areas include: \n\nClients – Access and manage your entire client portfolio from a single interface. \n\nUsers – Add/remove staff users. \n\nImports – Seamlessly import data to reduce manual entry. \n\nPermissions – Manage team access and roles across the platform. \n\nSuggested Articles:\n\nHow to purchase licenses for Capium 365\n\nCapium 365: Manage Clients\n\nCapium 365: Add Users\n\nCapium 365: Imports\n\nCapium 365: Permission\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
